# Keep the build context tiny: the corpus, caches, the compiled embed binary and
# the local kaggle staging are huge and never needed to build the server image.
# image-data/ is the ONLY data dir intentionally shipped (the CI puts the merged
# DB there to bake into the image); everything else under data/ is excluded.
.git
data/
!image-data/
embed
.kaggle-campaign/
.kaggle-lots/
dist/
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.zst
*.zst
.devcontainer/
.claude/
docs/
tests/
**/*_test.go
node_modules/
*.log
